on and a ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kristen_Bell\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d225\"},\"ref\":\"d225\",\"snippet\":\" ... The same year, her nephew Michael Korda, would publish Queenie, a fictional story based on Merle's life, which would later become a TV series, removing the stigma that Merle had fought her whole life to avoid.\\n\\nAs Mayukh Sen, a US-based writer and academic, so poignantly ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.messynessychic.com/2022/12/07/hollywoods-own-dark-angel-was-an-indian-actress-playing-the-biggest-role-of-her-life/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d226\"},\"ref\":\"d226\",\"snippet\":\" ... She and the cast of Veronica Mars were nominated for two Teen Choice Awards in 2005: \\\"Choice Breakout Actress\\\" and \\\"Choice Breakout TV Show\\\".\\n\\nIn 2006, Bell won the Saturn Award for \\\"Best Actress on Television\\\" for her acting on Veronica Mars, while the series was nominated for ... \",\"title\":\"https://unionfilms.org/films/people/kristen-bell.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d143\"},\"ref\":\"d143\",\"snippet\":\" ... Pearman, the father of \\\"That's So Raven\\\" actress Raven Simoné, passed away Oct. 1, a year after losing his son Blaize Pearman to colon cancer. The elder Pearman, 63, began co-managing his famous daughter's career when she joined the cast of the \\\"The Cosby Show ... \",\"title\":\"https://sacobserver.com/2024/12/gone-but-not-forgotten-2024/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d9\"},\"ref\":\"d9\",\"snippet\":\" ... The following year, he played the lead character in the first Mickey McGuire short film. It was in this popular film series that he took the stage name Mickey Rooney. Rooney reached new heights in 1937 with A Family Affair, the film that introduced the country to Andy ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1920\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d227\"},\"ref\":\"d227\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2016, scholar Afreen Khan cited Kapadia's character as a departure from the conventional portrayal of mothers in Hindi films, believing her role to be a modern mother whom daughters dream of having.\\n\\nIn 2006, Kapadia co-starred with Saif Ali Khan and Naseeruddin Shah in the ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimple_Kapadia\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d228\"},\"ref\":\"d228\",\"snippet\":\" ... actor on stage was having a real-life conniption. She did not look back until her escort commented that the young man was a great actor.\\n\\nThe problem with casting Brando as Stanley was that he was much younger than the character as written by Williams. However, after ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_date=1920-01-01%2C1929-12-31\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d145\"},\"ref\":\"d145\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her characters ranged from free and life-affirming to downright pitiable. Despite winning a Tony Award nomination and Outer Critic's Circle Award for her stark, touchingly sad portrait of a suicidal daughter in 1983's \\\"'night, Mother\\\" and the Obie and Los Angeles Drama Critics Award for ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_date=1940-01-01%2C1949-